.TH start-cli-server-set-log-level 1  "set-log-level "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-server\-set\-log\-level \- Set the running daemon\*(Aqs StartOS backend log level
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli server set\-log\-level\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fILEVEL\fR>
